  "description": "Seo Hae-young, the only light of Yoon Hae-won, who has no money, no family, and no future. After Ko Tae-gyeom, his \"friend,\" reveals his feelings for him, Hae-won's life begins to fall apart. \n\nTae-gyeom demands a relationship through threats, Hae-young wields violence in an unknown manner, and another friend Joo Hyun-woo joins the ranks... \n\nThe broken relationship between the four people, the memories of the past that are now faded. \n\nWho will win this irreversible game? \n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
